{"id":"derecha","lemma":"derecha","pos":"noun","rank":663,"glosses":["right (direction)","right (ensemble of right-wing political parties; political conservatives as a group)"],"ipa":"/deˈɾet͡ʃa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"derechas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-derecha.wav","examples":[{"text":"Quédate a la derecha.","en":"Keep to the right.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/721427","words":[{"g":"to be , to end up","l":"quedar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"El salón está a la derecha.","en":"The living room is on the right.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/508429","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"living room"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"A su derecha pueden ver el mar.","en":"If you look to your right, you'll see the sea.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1155069","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to see, to spot"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"sea"}]},{"text":"Me duele la pierna derecha.","en":"My right leg hurts.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449220","words":[{"g":"me"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"leg"},null]},{"text":"Su casa está allí a la derecha.","en":"His house is there on the right.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"house"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}